00:05:36.681 --> 00:05:39.667
And that's why I think that
like an academic environment

00:05:39.667 --> 00:05:42.390
is a great place for trying new things

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.117
and experimenting with new things.

00:05:44.117 --> 00:05:46.290
So, if your passion is painting,

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.997
