If you hack college in the way
that you're talking about it,

00:06:15.177 --> 00:06:17.046
you know, now you're
starting to think about,

00:06:17.046 --> 00:06:19.850
you know, course selection,
you're talking about

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.271
the kind of group of friends
that you're spending time with.

00:06:23.271 --> 00:06:26.278
- Yeah, but I think college is,

00:06:26.278 --> 00:06:29.610
can be a total waste of time and money

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:33.288
if not approached carefully,
and I think a lot of kids today

00:06:33.288 --> 00:06:34.629
