and certainly if there

00:06:36.234 --> 00:06:38.956
are better, other opportunities

00:06:38.956 --> 00:06:40.439
that feel better to you than college,

00:06:40.439 --> 00:06:43.284
I think now today, those
opportunities are...

00:06:43.284 --> 00:06:44.015
- Way more practical.

00:06:44.015 --> 00:06:48.181
- Are as practical as
an academic education.

00:06:48.181 --> 00:06:50.659
I can tell you that a big falsehood

00:06:50.659 --> 00:06:54.478
is that by going to college,
you will get something else.

00:06:54.478 --> 00:06:55.961
You will find success.

00:06:55.961 --> 00:06:58.826
And one thing that's
becoming more and more true,

00:06:58.826 --> 00:07:00.716
